{"seq":2,"slug":"skills-progressive-disclosure","title":"SKILL.md 与渐进披露机制","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/prompt-engineering/agents-md-and-skills-standards/skills-progressive-disclosure","wordCount":1360,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"skill-md-与渐进披露机制\">SKILL.md 与渐进披露机制</h1><blockquote>\n<p>&quot;AGENTS.md 是静态项目协议，SKILL.md 是动态过程性知识&quot;——两条标准在 token 经济学上互补而不重叠。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><code>SKILL.md</code> 解决的不是&quot;项目偏好怎么写&quot;，而是另一个更尖锐的问题：当一个 agent 被装上 50 个领域技能（写 SQL / 调试 GDB / 跑 K8s / 设计 React 组件 ...），怎么避免把所有指令一次性塞进 system prompt、把 8K context 烧个精光？答案是 <strong>progressive disclosure</strong>——会话启动只载入每个 skill 的 <code>name</code> + <code>description</code>（约 30-50 token / 个），匹配任务时才把对应 SKILL.md body（500-3000 token）注入上下文。这个机制由 Anthropic PM Mahesh Murag 在 2025 年下半年提出、2026 年 1 月以 Apache-2.0 协议发布到 <code>agentskills.io</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Skills 的格式与加载流程可以拆成三阶段：<strong>注册</strong>（agent 启动时扫描所有 <code>skill-name/SKILL.md</code>）、<strong>匹配</strong>（用户输入触发 description 匹配）、<strong>注入</strong>（命中的 skill body 进入 context）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[Agent 启动] --&gt; B[扫描 skills/ 目录]&#10;  B --&gt; C[读取每份 SKILL.md frontmatter]&#10;  C --&gt; D[仅保留 name + description&lt;br/&gt;到 system prompt]&#10;  D --&gt; E[用户输入 query]&#10;  E --&gt; F[模型基于 description 决定&lt;br/&gt;调用哪个 skill]&#10;  F --&gt; G[工具/agent 注入对应&lt;br/&gt;SKILL.md body + scripts/]&#10;  G --&gt; H[模型用完整指令完成任务]\">flowchart LR\n  A[Agent 启动] --&gt; B[扫描 skills/ 目录]\n  B --&gt; C[读取每份 SKILL.md frontmatter]\n  C --&gt; D[仅保留 name + description&lt;br/&gt;到 system prompt]\n  D --&gt; E[用户输入 query]\n  E --&gt; F[模型基于 description 决定&lt;br/&gt;调用哪个 skill]\n  F --&gt; G[工具/agent 注入对应&lt;br/&gt;SKILL.md body + scripts/]\n  G --&gt; H[模型用完整指令完成任务]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>必填</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型长度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>name</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>唯一标识，kebab-case</td>\n<td>10-30 字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>description</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>一句话说明触发场景，模型基于此决定调用</td>\n<td>60-200 字符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>version</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>语义化版本，便于工具更新</td>\n<td><code>0.1.0</code> 起步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>license</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>默认 Apache-2.0</td>\n<td>SPDX 标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tags</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>分类标签，便于 marketplace 检索</td>\n<td>3-8 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>requires</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>依赖的其它 skill 或 MCP server</td>\n<td>数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>inputs</code> / <code>outputs</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>形参 schema，供 IDE auto-complete</td>\n<td>JSON Schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>examples</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>调用示例，提高模型匹配准确率</td>\n<td>数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>其它 6+ 可选</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>homepage</code> / <code>author</code> / <code>repository</code> / <code>keywords</code> / <code>deprecated</code> / <code>since</code></td>\n<td>见 <code>agentskills.io/spec</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"目录结构与-frontmatter-最小集\">目录结构与 frontmatter 最小集</h2><p>一份合规的 skill 目录形如：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-skills/&#10;  sql-debugger/&#10;    SKILL.md          # 必备，含 frontmatter + body&#10;    scripts/          # 可选，提供给 skill 调用的脚本&#10;      analyze.py&#10;      explain.sql&#10;    examples/         # 可选，触发示例&#10;      slow-query.md\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-skills/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sql-debugger/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SKILL.md          # 必备，含 frontmatter + body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scripts/          # 可选，提供给 skill 调用的脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      analyze.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      explain.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    examples/         # 可选，触发示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      slow-query.md</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>SKILL.md</code> 的最小可用形态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;name: sql-debugger&#10;description: 当用户粘贴 SQL 慢查询、提到 explain plan、或问&quot;为什么这个 query 慢&quot;时调用。&#10;version: 0.1.0&#10;license: Apache-2.0&#10;---&#10;&#10;# SQL 慢查询诊断&#10;&#10;## 步骤&#10;&#10;1. 运行 EXPLAIN ANALYZE&#10;2. 关注 Seq Scan / Sort / Nested Loop&#10;3. 检查统计信息是否陈旧（pg_stats）&#10;   ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">sql-debugger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">description</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">当用户粘贴 SQL 慢查询、提到 explain plan、或问\"为什么这个 query 慢\"时调用。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">license</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Apache-2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># SQL 慢查询诊断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 步骤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">1.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 运行 EXPLAIN ANALYZE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">2.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 关注 Seq Scan / Sort / Nested Loop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">3.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 检查统计信息是否陈旧（pg_stats）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Body 部分是 agent 实际遵循的过程性指令，可以包含代码、表格、bash 命令——只要是 Markdown 合法语法即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"progressive-disclosure-的-token-经济学\">Progressive Disclosure 的 token 经济学</h2><p>这是 Skills 设计的灵魂。假设一个开发者装了 50 个 skill，平均 SKILL.md body 1500 token：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>启动 token</th>\n<th>单次任务 token</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全量装入 system prompt</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1500</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>75000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 \\times 1500 = 75000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75000</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>不可行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Progressive disclosure</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>2000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 \\times 40 \\approx 2000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>可扩展到数百 skill</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAG 向量检索</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span></span></span></span></span>（embedding 索引元数据）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1500</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1500 + 200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> overhead</td>\n<td>适合 1000+ 文档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MCP tool discovery</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1250</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 \\times 25 = 1250</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1250</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span> + tool call roundtrip</td>\n<td>跨进程，延迟更高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Progressive disclosure 的关键洞察是：<strong>模型本身就擅长根据短描述匹配能力</strong>——这与 GPT-4 系列被广泛用于&quot;函数调用 description-based dispatch&quot;是同一机制。把 description 写好（清晰说明触发场景），匹配准确率就高，不需要额外的 RAG 索引或向量库。</p>\n<p>数学上，若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是 skill 数量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均 description token、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均 body token、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是命中率（通常 1，因为模型一次只调一个 skill），则会话总 token 开销为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = n \\cdot d + h \\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>相比全量装入的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，节省比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\frac{n \\cdot d + h \\cdot b}{n \\cdot b} \\approx 1 - \\frac{d}{b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2251em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8801em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d=40, b=1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span> 时约节省 97%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-跨工具适配\">2026 跨工具适配</h2><p><code>SKILL.md</code> 在 2026 上半年已被 16+ 工具支持，但分两层：<strong>base SKILL.md 跨工具直读</strong>——任何合规 SKILL.md 在任何支持的工具里都能加载；<strong>扩展字段各家叠加</strong>——工具可在 frontmatter 添加自家 namespace 字段，遵守 agentskills.io 的 RFC 流程。</p>\n<p>典型扩展示例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Claude Code</strong> 在 frontmatter 加 <code>context: fork</code>（控制 skill body 是否进入子 agent context）、<code>allowed-tools</code> 限制可调用工具</li>\n<li><strong>Codex</strong> 加 <code>openai.yaml</code> sidecar 文件 + frontmatter <code>openai.role: developer | assistant</code> 字段</li>\n<li><strong>OpenCode</strong> 加 <code>instructions.attach: true</code> 让 skill 也参与 instructions 字段聚合</li>\n<li><strong>Cursor</strong> 加 <code>cursor.rules.scope</code> 把 skill 限定在编辑器特定模式下激活</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关键点：<strong>base SKILL.md 字段（<code>name</code> / <code>description</code> / <code>version</code> / <code>license</code> / <code>tags</code> / <code>requires</code> / <code>inputs</code> / <code>outputs</code> / <code>examples</code> 等）跨工具语义一致</strong>，扩展字段被不支持的工具静默忽略，不破坏可移植性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-agents-md-的角色分工\">与 AGENTS.md 的角色分工</h2><p>两份开放标准在同一仓库里并存的典型布局：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"my-project/&#10;  AGENTS.md                # 项目协议：测试命令、代码规范、commit 风格&#10;  AGENTS.local.md          # 个人偏好（gitignored）&#10;  .agents/skills/          # 团队共享 skill 目录&#10;    code-reviewer/&#10;      SKILL.md&#10;    db-migrator/&#10;      SKILL.md&#10;  ~/.agents/skills/        # 用户级 skill（跨项目）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>my-project/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AGENTS.md                # 项目协议：测试命令、代码规范、commit 风格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AGENTS.local.md          # 个人偏好（gitignored）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  .agents/skills/          # 团队共享 skill 目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    code-reviewer/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      SKILL.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    db-migrator/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      SKILL.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ~/.agents/skills/        # 用户级 skill（跨项目）</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><code>AGENTS.md</code> 回答&quot;在这个仓库工作时永远要遵守的偏好&quot; → 100% 进入 context</li>\n<li><code>SKILL.md</code> 回答&quot;具备这些可调用的过程性能力&quot; → 仅 description 进入 context，body 按需注入</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者在 token 上完全互补：AGENTS.md 应当短（&lt; 300 行）、SKILL.md 数量可以多（progressive disclosure 控制开销）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>description 写得太泛</strong>：写&quot;用于数据库&quot;，模型在面对&quot;GraphQL schema 设计&quot;时也可能误调；正确做法是把触发条件写具体——&quot;当用户提到 PostgreSQL / EXPLAIN / 慢查询 / 索引时调用&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>body 写得太长</strong>：单份 SKILL.md body 超过 5000 token 时，本身就把 progressive disclosure 的节省吃掉一半；应当拆成多个细粒度 skill，每个聚焦一个动作。</li>\n<li><strong>依赖未声明</strong>：skill A 调 skill B 但没写 <code>requires: [B]</code>，B 没装时 A 静默失效——agentskills.io 规范要求 <code>requires</code> 字段必须被工具校验。</li>\n<li><strong>scripts/ 路径不可移植</strong>：在 SKILL.md body 里写绝对路径 <code>/Users/foo/scripts/analyze.py</code> 会让 skill 无法跨机器使用，正确做法是用相对路径 <code>./scripts/analyze.py</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>混淆 SKILL.md 与 MCP server</strong>：两者都是&quot;agent 的可调用能力&quot;，但 SKILL.md 是同进程文本指令、MCP 是跨进程 RPC——选型见 <a href=\"../../mcp/\"><code>../../2_mcp/</code></a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SKILL.md 是 agentskills.io（Apache-2.0）2026-01 发布的开放标准，与 AGENTS.md 同属 AAIF / Linux Foundation 治理</li>\n<li>核心设计 progressive disclosure：启动仅载入 name + description（约 50 个 skill ≈ 1500-2500 token），匹配任务才注入 body</li>\n<li>必填字段仅两个（name / description），可选 14+ 字段覆盖版本、依赖、IO schema、示例等</li>\n<li>跨工具：base 字段直读，扩展字段（Claude Code <code>context</code> / Codex <code>openai.yaml</code> / OpenCode <code>instructions.attach</code>）由各家叠加</li>\n<li>与 AGENTS.md 角色互补：前者是动态过程性能力（按需注入），后者是静态项目协议（常驻 context）</li>\n<li>实战陷阱：description 写泛、body 过长、依赖未声明、scripts 绝对路径</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SKILL.md 与渐进披露机制","id":"skill-md-与渐进披露机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"目录结构与 frontmatter 最小集","id":"目录结构与-frontmatter-最小集"},{"level":2,"text":"Progressive Disclosure 的 token 经济学","id":"progressive-disclosure-的-token-经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 跨工具适配","id":"2026-跨工具适配"},{"level":2,"text":"与 AGENTS.md 的角色分工","id":"与-agents-md-的角色分工"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"AGENTS.md 规范本体与治理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/prompt-engineering/agents-md-and-skills-standards/agents-md-spec-and-governance"},"next":{"title":"OpenCode：`instructions` 字段与 AGENTS.md 早期采纳","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/coding-tools/prompt-engineering/per-tool-deep-dive/opencode-instructions-and-rules"}}